A [[Sentience|sentient]] winged '''species''' lived within [[the galaxy]]. The [[species]] possessed [[Color|gray]] and brown feathers and had the ability to fly. The [[astronomer]] [[Kh'ymm]] was a member of the species.<ref name="Astrogation Problem" />

{{Species-stub}}

==Behind the scenes==
The species was created for the character Kh'ymm, who appears in the live-action television series ''[[Star Wars: Skeleton Crew]]'', where she was voiced by [[Alia Shawkat]].<ref name="Astrogation Problem" />

